# Scratch working files. These are the by-products of the security
# review -- the patches it was applied as, the one-off probes and status
# scripts, and the report it was written up in -- and they are kept out
# of the history on purpose: the reviewed result is in the commits and
# in docs/security/, which is the record worth reading.
*.patch
check3-*
signflow-*.cmd
signflow-report.md

